share/Rexfile ~line 742-744 (sub _default_pod_cidr comment) says: "this is the fallback for hand-runs and for robocop's control-plane joins, which never see ocp.yaml." That is stale since 2588109 (k186, k184): robocop now passes pod_cidr as OCP_POD_CIDR env to OCP::Node->install_rke2_server on CP joins, so CP joins are no longer limited to the built-in fallback. Left alone during k184 because k185 was working in share/Rexfile at the time. Done: reword the comment to reflect that robocop CP joins now carry pod_cidr via OCP_POD_CIDR, fallback applies to hand-runs only.
